  "body": "i still have some presence issues\nThe tests have been done around 07/08/2016 at 10:50 UK time.\n\n@ylecollen:matrix.org and @ylecollen2001:matrix.org discussed in https://vector.im/beta/#/room/!HyEinSjhPKvSyHeSyz:matrix.org\n\n-> each account uses 2 clients (one webclient and one mobile client)\nThe clients are in foreground\n\nThe following presences are the same on each client (web, IOS or android)\n\n1 - ylecollen2001 backgrounds / debackgrounds his mobile client : the ylecollen2001 status is not \"online\"\n2 - the ylecollen2001 presence is never seen online whereas ylecollen2001 is sending message\n\nSo, the presence seems bugged on server side.\n",
